  "question": "计算 $I = \\int_{1 / 4}^{1 / 2}\\mathrm{d}y\\int_{1 / 2}^{\\sqrt{y}}\\mathrm{e}^{\\frac{y}{x}}\\mathrm{d}x + \\int_{1 / 2}^{1}\\mathrm{d}y\\int_{y}^{\\sqrt{y}}\\mathrm{e}^{\\frac{y}{x}}\\mathrm{d}x.$",
